To the extent that Astrato's standard terms restrict activities expressly permitted by this license, these permissions prevail solely for the Software and within the scope of this license.

All other applicable Astrato terms, contractual obligations and subscription restrictions remain effective.

A separately signed agreement expressly addressing these libraries takes precedence to the extent of any conflict.

